---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AdSlot from '../components/AdSlot.astro';

const pageTitle = 'About Us & Methodology — TokenFinOps';
const pageDescription = 'Learn about the TokenFinOps mission, our deterministic calculation methodology, and how we help engineering organizations optimize generative AI unit economics.';
---

<Layout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription} canonicalUrl="/about">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="space-y-4 mb-8 border-b border-slate-800 pb-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-mono uppercase font-bold bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20">
        Mission & Architecture
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">About TokenFinOps</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Building the standard financial operating model for enterprise generative AI APIs and production token pipelines.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-8">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Why We Built TokenFinOps</h2>
        <p>
          In 2024 and 2025, early enterprise AI adopters treated LLM API calls as experimental R&D line items. As applications moved to general availability in 2026, engineering organizations experienced severe gross margin compression driven by unexpected billing factors:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-slate-300">
          <li><strong>Multi-turn conversational inflation:</strong> Re-sending full message histories compounded prompt sizes exponentially.</li>
          <li><strong>Underutilized prompt caching:</strong> Overpaying 9x for static prefixes that should have been cached.</li>
          <li><strong>Context-window cliff penalties:</strong> Unknowingly crossing provider surcharge thresholds that doubled input rates.</li>
          <li><strong>Monolithic model selection:</strong> Over-allocating frontier reasoning models to trivial data formatting chores.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          TokenFinOps was architected to eliminate these blind spots with a completely deterministic, open, and client-side simulator.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Our 5-Variable Mathematical Engine</h2>
        <p>
          Unlike naive calculators that simply multiply single-shot token counts by rate cards, TokenFinOps models real-world enterprise infrastructure:
        </p>
        <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2 text-slate-300">
          <li><strong>Unit Conversion:</strong> Translates raw customer inputs (Words, Characters, Clean PDF Pages, and Scanned OCR Pages) into BPE token counts.</li>
          <li><strong>Quadratic Compounding:</strong> Models $(N \times S) + \sum (i \times U + (i-1) \times O)$ to determine exact cumulative input tokens and peak single-turn context limits.</li>
          <li><strong>Prompt Caching ROI:</strong> Splits fresh input from cached read tokens to capture up to 90% provider savings.</li>
          <li><strong>Context Cliff Surcharges:</strong> Detects when single-turn prompts breach provider cliff thresholds (e.g., 128k tokens) and applies long-context rate multiples.</li>
          <li><strong>Smart Cascading Recommendation:</strong> Quantifies the exact monthly savings of hybrid routing 70% of simpler queries to budget tier alternatives.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Editorial Independence & Data Accuracy</h2>
        <p>
          TokenFinOps is an independent benchmarking platform. We do not accept payment or sponsorship from foundation model providers to inflate or artificially favor any specific model. Our model database (`models.json`) is maintained daily by cross-referencing official documentation from OpenAI, Anthropic, Google Cloud, AWS, Microsoft Azure, and DeepSeek.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12">
      <AdSlot slotType="footer" />
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
